{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2f3a2663-0ec4-8b72-a5db-a92faa9dc299",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T10:40:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Elvis Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:37:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:37:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. Yes, um, I am calling about my trash bin. The truck, it broke my bin this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:37:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Sorry about that. Which bin, the trash or the recycling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:37:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The trash one. The big one with the wheels. The lid is [line breaks up] cracked, and one side, it is, how do you say, split open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:37:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Cracked lid and a split side. And what's the address where it happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:37:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 426 Bacheller Street. In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:37:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "426 Bacheller. Okay. And was it the truck that did it, did you see it, or you just found it like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:38:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I was inside, but I heard it. When I came out, the bin was on the side, and the plastic is broken here, by the handle. I think the arm of the truck, it grabbed too hard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:38:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that can happen. Is the bin still usable, or is it leaking, falling apart?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:38:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[inaudible] sorry, can you say again? The line is not so good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:38:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you still use it? Or is it too broken to hold trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:38:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, no. I can not use it. The trash will fall out on the side. I put it by the door for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So you'd need a replacement. I can put in a request for that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:38:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, that is very kind. Um, is there a fee? For the new one? I want to know before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:38:53-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the truck damaged it, you generally shouldn't be charged, but I'll note it as collection damage so the crew supervisor can look at it. If there's anything about cost, they'll tell you when they follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:39:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. That is good. I can wait. I am the youngest of seven, so I learned to be patient, you know. [pause] Always I am last to get things."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:39:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'll try to move you up the line. Is the best number to reach you this one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:39:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Elvis Spencer. Elvis, like the singer. Spencer, S-P-E-N-C-E-R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:39:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Mr. Spencer. I've got the damaged bin at 426 Bacheller Street, cracked lid and split side, hit by the truck this morning. Someone should call you back in a few days about the replacement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:39:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days, okay. Should I leave the broken one outside for them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, just leave it by the curb or by your door where they can see it, and keep using whatever you have for the meantime, even a sturdy barrel with a lid if you need to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:40:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will do that. Thank you very much, Denise. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T10:40:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Spencer. Bye now."
    }
  ],
